WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.676
A stimulus is any change the body detects, inside or outside it.

2
00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:09.052
A stimulus is any change the body detects.

3
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.435
A change outside: receptors detect it, and muscles respond.

4
00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:23.887
A change inside counts too: the brain detects it, and you sweat.
